{"title":"Together Toronto and YC Winter 2027 (W27) Application Session","startsAt":"2026-10-05T18:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-05T21:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**This is a paid event. You must register and have a ticket to attend.** 👉 **[Together Toronto and YC Winter 2027 (W27) Application Session](https://luma.com/together-toronto-october-2026)**\n\n**Together Toronto - the stories behind how companies actually get built here.**\n\nThe stories that actually shape how companies get built in this city rarely make it onto a stage. This one's different.\n\nTogether Toronto is TechTO's signature gathering for founders, operators, builders, and investors who want more than inspiration - they want the real playbook. Real founders. Honest conversations about what it took to launch, scale, and survive Toronto's tech scene.\n\nWhether you're building your first company, scaling a team, or figuring out what's next - this is the event worth showing up for.\n\n**You'll leave with:**\n\n* Founder stories with the specifics left in\n* Connections with the people building what's next\n* Conversations that challenge how you think about your own company\n\n📅 Monday\\, Oct 5\\| 6PM\\- 9PM\n📍 Downtown Toronto\n🎟️ Paid event \\- tickets required \\| Free for TechTO Members\n\n**Register via Luma:** [https://luma.com/together-toronto-october-2026](https://luma.com/together-toronto-october-2026)","venue":{"name":"U of T: Schwartz Reisman Innovation Campus","address":"108 College St, Toronto, ON","lat":43.660328,"lng":-79.389145,"city":"Toronto, ON"},"fee":null,"group":"TechTO","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/8/0/e/d/highres_536073005.jpeg"}